msgid "exec 参数与初始栈"
msgstr "exec Arguments and Initial Stack"

msgid ""
"``execve`` 与 ``execveat`` 使用 Linux x86_64 的参数容量规则，不能用较小的独立 环境项数量限制来代替字节预算。参考 Linux "
"``fs/exec.c:bprm_stack_limits()`` 与 ``include/uapi/linux/binfmts.h``："
msgstr ""
"``execve`` and ``execveat`` use Linux x86_64 argument capacity rules; a smaller independent limit "
"on the number of environment entries must not replace the byte budget. See Linux "
"``fs/exec.c:bprm_stack_limits()`` and ``include/uapi/linux/binfmts.h``:"

msgid ""
"总预算为 ``max(128 KiB, min(6 MiB, RLIMIT_STACK.rlim_cur / 4))``。 默认 8 MiB 软栈限制对应 2 MiB，软栈限制无限时仍有 6 "
"MiB 上限。"
msgstr ""
"The total budget is ``max(128 KiB, min(6 MiB, RLIMIT_STACK.rlim_cur / 4))``. The default 8 MiB "
"soft stack limit gives 2 MiB; even an unlimited soft stack limit is capped at 6 MiB."

msgid "预算包含字符串的 NUL、原始执行文件名和 argv/envp 的指针开销；空参数 向量也为 Linux 补入的空 ``argv[0]`` 保留空间。"
msgstr ""
"The budget includes string NULs, the original executable filename, and argv/envp pointer overhead."
" Even an empty argument vector reserves space for the empty ``argv[0]`` supplied by Linux."

msgid "每个参数或环境字符串最多 32 个 4 KiB 页面，含末尾 NUL。"
msgstr ""
"Each argument or environment string is limited to 32 pages of 4 KiB each, including the trailing "
"NUL."

msgid "argv 和 envp 各自的计数上限为 ``0x7fffffff``，实际可传数量先受总字节 预算约束。超限返回 ``E2BIG``；不可读的用户地址返回 ``EFAULT``。"
msgstr ""
"argv and envp each have a count limit of ``0x7fffffff``; the total byte budget constrains the "
"practical count first. Exceeding limits returns ``E2BIG``; unreadable user addresses return "
"``EFAULT``."

msgid ""
"用户向量先计数，再在内核堆上分配暂存空间并按页复制字符串。并发改变向量 不能导致越过已分配容量；所有失败路径释放临时内存。任务保留的参数副本按 实际大小分配，fork 复制，exec "
"提交时替换，退出时释放。fork 不重新按照调用者 可能已调小的栈限制拒绝继承旧参数。"
msgstr ""
"User vectors are counted first, then staging storage is allocated on the kernel heap and strings "
"copied page by page. Concurrent vector changes must not exceed allocated capacity; every failure "
"path frees temporary memory. Retained task argument copies are sized to actual data, copied by "
"fork, replaced when exec commits, and freed on exit. fork does not reject inherited arguments by "
"rechecking a stack limit the caller may have lowered."

msgid ""
"初始用户栈按实际布局补充页面，沿用栈增长的 ``RLIMIT_STACK``、``RLIMIT_AS`` 检查和不可执行页面权限。新地址空间、ELF、栈和参数都准备完成后才提交 "
"exec；失败保留旧映像、描述符和信号状态。内部 boot/service launch 请求仍 使用原有的小型固定请求结构，该结构不限制 Linux exec 系统调用。"
msgstr ""
"The initial user stack gains pages according to its actual layout, retaining stack-growth checks "
"for ``RLIMIT_STACK`` and ``RLIMIT_AS`` and non-executable page permissions. exec commits only "
"after the new address space, ELF, stack, and arguments are ready; failure preserves the old image,"
" descriptors, and signal state. Internal boot/service launch requests retain their small fixed "
"request structure, which does not limit Linux exec syscalls."

msgid ""
"本仓 ``tools/test_exec_script.py`` 对生产参数复制和 shebang 重写运行 ASan/UBSan 测试；``tools/test_exec_limits.py``"
" 在 Linux 上运行边界 参照。对应的 ``tools/tests/exec_limits_runtime_probe.c`` 可以在 ReliefOS 内用 GCC "
"编译并运行同一组用例，以验证真实系统调用与初始栈布局。测试必须区分 宿主测试、内核编译和来宾运行，不以其中一项替代另一项。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_exec_script.py`` in this repository runs ASan/UBSan tests on production argument "
"copying and shebang rewriting; ``tools/test_exec_limits.py`` runs boundary references on Linux. "
"The corresponding ``tools/tests/exec_limits_runtime_probe.c`` can be compiled with GCC inside "
"ReliefOS and run with the same cases to validate actual syscalls and initial stack layout. Host "
"tests, kernel compilation, and guest execution must be distinguished; none replaces another."

